    {
        "text": "7:25 A.M. \\ Overcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ten kilometers from Londinium, wilderness highway"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_empty"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blacksteel's aircraft was about a hundred meters ahead of our position when its signal disappeared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me grab the telescope to pinpoint the precise location\u2013\u2013 Wait, why are you standing up?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you smell the smoke?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't think so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You can put that lump of metal down. The aircraft is right ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to scout out the enemy's numbers first?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't be any more than thirty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh, you can tell all that from smell alone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The hell are you talking about? Before we left, Morgan told me they usually run in squads of thirty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right, that's what the intel Misery sent back said. Patterns tell us they should have two other squads nearby to offer mutual support.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. They act like they own the damned place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't do anything rash. Amiya said not to make too much of a ruckus before we get into Londinium. Too many forces have their eyes on us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Balin, how long has it been since you joined the bunny's squad and started working with us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "About five days since leaving the landship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And do you know how long it took for Siege to go from joining the Glasgow Gang to becoming my boss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Two days. She only needed two days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "First day, she beat me down. Second day, we beat down a band of ill-intentioned Leithanians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Since then, we've had a bond that goes beyond life and death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though we haven't been working together very long, I have full confidence in your strength, Indra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what I like to hear. Let's go, we need to catch up to Dagda.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dagda's already moved out?! Are you telling me dark shadow that shot past was...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "When she first joined the gang, she had her nose turned up like some fancy knight-noble. Now whenever there's a fight, she's the first one to leap in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're gonna have to pick up the pace, or she'll clean house before we even get there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dagda throws a mean punch, and I can bet you she'll flip on top of the aircraft from the side. We'll wrap around the back, get rid of anyone there, and bust our way inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I'll cover you then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "After this fight, you'll be a blood brother.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha... Haha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If I was to describe it in Rhodes Island's terms... Lemme think. Something like this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our objectives are two rescues: one Londinium citizen and one Blacksteel pilot. Opposing forces are\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dublinn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
