        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You, stop squirming. Don't even try to reach for the transmitter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "D-Don't kill me! My hand's gone numb and I just wanted to shake it out a little...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be too forceful. If you really end up killing the bloke, how are you gonna explain it to the captain when we get back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget, this is our objective. Securing our flight back is just a matter of convenience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know how to operate it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a clue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's why you shouldn't have killed the damned pilot as soon as you got in here! If you ask me, we stop wasting time, take this one back, and leave this rubbish heap behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All the men along the road outside are ours. What difference does it make if we take some extra time? The Sarkaz are inside the city, and the Grand Duke's army is stationed in the barracks of the annexed plate. Nobody's gonna bother us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "G-Gentlemen, are you not Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your eyes fall out of your head? Do we look anything like that filth to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "F-Filth, huh... Haha... You're exactly right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough. Don't talk to the Londiniers unless you're interrogating them. If this runt has the stones to cross the Sarkaz, there's no saying who we might be dealing with here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right, we should be on the cautious side. Hurry it up, I'm gonna see what the commotion is out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier A"
    },
