    },
    {
        "text": "Black... claws? Some sort of wild beast?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-No! It's\u2013\u2013 some kind of special weapon!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All hands, an enemy is hiding atop the aircraft! They're... trying to rip apart the metal\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
