        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You managed to block me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The intel was right, you aren't just a band of highwaymen. You grew fat off Victoria's teat, and this is how you repay her, soldier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*... You're pretty strong. You working for the devils?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Bastard!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How dare you... I'm pissed enough to beat the tar out of you ten times over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember this, Dublinn soldier. We will reclaim Londinium from her usurpers. Be it from the Sarkaz, or from you traitors\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your time running around like you own this place is over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
