        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Urgh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many times have I told you? When you're in a fight, always be on the lookout for tricks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because I helped you clean up a band of hooligans outside, no? Hey, tell her, how many did we have to go through outside? Seven, or was it eight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't a competition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what your face is saying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back when we went on our first mission together, that one merc got away from you. You were livid for three days. Morgan thought you\u2019d come down with some awful sickness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You had the same look on your face just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened back then was my fault. Plus, it was a long, long time ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*... Where... did you people come from? The one in black... I thought she was some knight-noble. But the way you hit is like...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like a street thug? Hah, you know your stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up. That one's no weakling. It'll be tougher to take him down than the unconscious louts out outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're able to freely move between the Sarkaz and the Duke's forces, and even able to control major passages in and out of Londinium. Dublinn isn't some ragtag group of mercs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to rescue the hostages as quickly as possible and get to somewhere safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. 'Your time running around like you own the place is over,' right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That\u2019s a lousy one-liner, not nearly scary enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember what I taught you? What you say is\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is your last chance to beg for mercy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
